        "original_id": "bf81890f-24eb-5625-b6c5-9898a8536898",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Steyr Mannlicher, Steyr-Daimler-Puch\n- Products: Steyr SSG 08\n- Places: Steyr, Austria\n\nFacts:\n- Steyr-Daimler-Puch was a large manufacturing conglomerate based in Steyr, Austria.\n- Steyr-Daimler-Puch was broken up in stages between 1987 and 2001.\n- Steyr Mannlicher was originally part of Steyr-Daimler-Puch.\n- Steyr Mannlicher became independent in 1989 when Steyr-Daimler-Puch was broken up.\n- The Steyr SSG 08 is a modern bolt-action sniper rifle.\n- The Steyr SSG 08 was developed and produced by Steyr Mannlicher in Austria.\n- The name Steyr SSG 08 expands from the German Scharfschützengewehr 2008 and translates to English as Sniper Rifle 08.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
